    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d134">

                <pb facs="0213" n="139" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg139"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        King.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 41.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-08-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 15, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I Have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    despatch of the 14th of July, (No. 59,) and your private note of the same date,
                    and to inform you, in reply, that I have enclosed a copy of the former, together
                    with the sworn statement of H. B. de St. Marie, which accompanied it, for the
                    consideration of the Secretary of War.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rufus King,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
